2. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY

   The Software contains original works of authorship including but not limited to:

   a. NovaLang - A custom ternary programming language and runtime.
   b. NovaX Ternary Transformer - A neural network architecture with weights
      constrained to {-1, 0, +1} trained via quantization-aware training.
   c. TZip Compression - A ternary packing algorithm achieving 99.05% of the
      Shannon information-theoretic limit.
   d. Navier-Stokes Query Routing - A fluid dynamics-based AI model routing
      system using Reynolds number classification.
   e. The NovaX Orchestrator, HiveMind, Cloud Router, and all associated
      microservice architectures.
